# IsoRim vacsuit + helmet (Claude, tools/make_vacsuit.py, 2026-11-11). stuff_*: multiplied by the item's colour
# (the vacsuit is untinted: white undyed), like vanilla's untinted sprites. Kd sampled from the vanilla sprites.
# Also uses isorim.mtl stuff_plain (white: shells, pads, back plate) and stuff_plain_deep (0.6: the filter cans' core).
newmtl stuff_vac_suit
Kd 0.280 0.280 0.280
newmtl stuff_vac_hole
Kd 0.180 0.180 0.180
newmtl stuff_vac_line
Kd 0.090 0.090 0.090
newmtl stuff_vac_port
Kd 0.400 0.400 0.400
# the small details (valves) as a texture: Kd 0.926 x TextureLift 1.08 = 1, so the white around them meets stuff_plain
newmtl stuff_vac_decal
Kd 0.926 0.926 0.926
map_Kd IsoRim/People/VacsuitDecals
